    description: Some("An alphabet cycles at the edge of the screen and you lock in one letter at a time, filling a hidden word of up to six characters drawn from lists graded from first grade to high school. Eleven wrong guesses complete the gallows — from which a monkey, not a man, hangs by one arm."),
